# Project Architecture

Read `docs/ai-context.md` and nearby source before broad changes.

- `src/grid/` is the pure deterministic grid domain. It owns config normalization, masks, seeded PRNG, generation, and validation. Do not import React here.
- `src/canvas/` owns Canvas rendering, hit testing, and PNG export. Keep editor rendering and export rendering aligned through `drawDocument`.
- `src/components/` owns reusable React UI, component registries, icon registries, and shared controls.
- `src/app/App.tsx` is orchestration: app state, wiring, drag flow, and top-level layout. Move reusable logic out when it grows.
- Prefer registry-backed extensions over duplicated switch logic. Add new component and icon behavior through `componentRegistry.ts`, `iconRegistry.ts`, canvas drawing, and tests.
- Do not edit `.cursor/plans` unless the user explicitly asks.
